{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/title00_EN.png?t=1749608059\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the battle stadium floating in a sky-high city, where a cast of unique characters gathers for thrilling territory battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your futuristic pogosticks\u2014 &quot;pogo gear&quot; !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your rhythm, and pull off awesome tricks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Claim victory in the POGO Stadium!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/gif00_trick.gif?t=1749608059\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/title01_EN.png?t=1749608059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you drop into the arena, smash through the floors made of blocks and carve out your own territory.<br>Disconnect sections of the floor to create isolated zones\u2014these become your turf!<br>Gather energy as you claim ground, and use it to attack your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But watch your step\u2014secure your landing spots, or you might fall.<br>If you drop, you'll return to your own base... and from there, you'll only be able to move on the floors you\u2019ve separated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/gif01_jinti_get.gif?t=1749608059\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/title02_EN.png?t=1749608059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle locally with up to four players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your strategy around each stadium's unique layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch up your attack style by customizing your pogo gear, and find your own approach to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All characters have equal abilities\u2014winning comes down to skill alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/gif02_attack.gif?t=1749608059\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/title03_EN.png?t=1749608059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle a host of unique solo stages in single-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against mysterious dark shadows modeled after yourself, and out-of-control system robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the secrets hidden somewhere in the sky city, and solve the mysteries using your rhythm and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/extras/gif03_soro.gif?t=1749608059\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672410?t=1749608059","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672410?t=1749608059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/7cd05c5341d539a5f4d910142ef78b92bf2d09ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749608059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672410/7cd05c5341d539a5f4d910142ef78b92bf2d09ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749608059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing